1. WHAT THIS COVERS

"C-Vert" means the files in this repository (the C source in core/ and app/, the assets, the
documentation, the tools and the tests), and the program built from them. "The Program" means a
built, ready-to-run copy of C-Vert released by the author. It does NOT include the Third-Party Components of section 6, which keep their own licenses.

