4. WHAT YOU MAKE WITH C-VERT ("OUTPUT")

"Output" means everything the Program creates or helps you create: your meshes and scenes, the OBJ
and .cbshader files it saves, and images it renders or screenshots it takes.

The author owns no part of your Output. The author grants you a worldwide, perpetual, irrevocable,
